{"created": "2025-02-12T07:50:47.613528+00:00", "modified": "2025-07-25T10:44:35.898063+00:00", "id": 14855145, "conceptrecid": "14855144", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14855145", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.14855144", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14855145", "metadata": {"title": "Data for publication: Fragment to Framework: Bottom-Up Engineering of the Band Gaps in Covalent Organic Frameworks", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14855145", "publication_date": "2025-02-11", "description": "<p>This record contains data for the unpublished manuscript titled <em>Fragment to Framework: Bottom-Up Engineering of the Band Gaps in Covalent Organic Frameworks</em>. The file <em>COFsalldata_forplots.csv</em> summarizes all calculated band gaps and the HOMO and LUMO energies of the building blocks for the COFs in the CoRE-COF-v5 database. The file <em>PCAdata.csv</em> includes topological descriptors (volume, density, and surface area) from the CoRE-COF-v5 database, along with band gap, HOMO-LUMO gap, and the number of B, N, and O atoms&mdash;these are the descriptors used in the principal component analysis.<br>1.d12 is the input for the Crystal17 calculation of the first COF in the database and 1.out the respective output. The node, linker, and node+linker files are the ORCA calculations for the building blocks of the first COF. All other COFs were calculated analogously.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Ernst, Michelle", "affiliation": "University of Zurich", "orcid": "0000-0001-8900-4240"}], "version": "1", "resource_type": {"title": "Other", "type": "other"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "101042290", "internal_id": "10.13039/501100000780::101042290", "funder": {"name": "European Commission", "doi": "10.13039/501100000780", "acronym": "EC"}, "title": "Shape and Topology as Descriptors of Chemical and Physical Properties in Functional Organic Materials", "acronym": "PATTERNCHEM", "program": "HORIZON.1.1", "url": "https://cordis.europa.eu/projects/101042290", "doi": "10.3030/101042290"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "14855144"}}]}}, "title": "Data for publication: Fragment to Framework: Bottom-Up Engineering of the Band Gaps in Covalent Organic Frameworks", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14855145", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14855145?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14855145", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14855145", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.14855145", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855144", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14855144", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14855144", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.14855144", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:14855145/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:14855145/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145/media-files", "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14855145/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14855145/access